OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start it will be
OL,6,Fa morning of patchy cloud and
OL,7,Fscattered showers. Becoming drier
OL,8,Ftowards midday with sunny spells
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells at first this
OL,12,Fevening, but becoming overcast towards
OL,13,Fmidnight with outbreaks of rain or
OL,14,Fdrizzle arriving from the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FRather cloudy with spells of
OL,17,Flight rain or drizzle, especially
OL,18,Fthrough the morning. Likely becoming
OL,19,Fdrier by the evening with a few clear
OL,20,Fspells, but further rain overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
